{"title":"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/8/5b87d6fad650516c7e8b1da077c6e3e7c3530c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\circleddash$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e046f33650006578bdb39eb59d1183b77df63dd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\circleddash b = a^{b} - b^{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"19\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/6/236e7940164a63f5ad107b7e190072c760de2efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\circleddash (2 \\circleddash 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We follow <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>.\n</p><p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/4/af43e477b62e098d7ac77a207d46fad8d4ae72c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\circleddash 5 = 2^{5} - 5^{2} = 32 - 25 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e1d948c84c523f57cfeae62d8e87166b8e58569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\circleddash (2 \\circleddash 5) = 2 \\circleddash 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/3368dfb7fb5e7a16abb8b2b758574a316955be88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{7} - 7^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3dd6d5c31dc039548d469dba05ba5de8ab0b97ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=128 - 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef09c7ba184ca2dd065b38fc63fa7fe41cda8eb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC\">2016 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Individual Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\